     techniques to your own non-commercial projects;
  3. copy, modify and redistribute this project and derivative works for
     non-commercial purposes, provided this license and the copyright
     notice above are retained in full.

You may NOT:

  1. use this project or any derivative work for any commercial purpose,
     including but not limited to: selling the project or any product or
     service based on it; shipping it as part of a commercial product or
     service; offering commercial hosting, managed deployment or paid
     setup services based on it; using it in paid courses, paid content
     or commercial training material;
